{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFXnaajTd7qzGEG5dGRU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I wrote `render-report.sh`, which renders `report.metais` from a single JSON file. I tested it here: the output matches the package's own expected output byte for byte.\n\n**What `report.metais` is:** a zip containing a METAIS template for a DORA incident report (the EU's major ICT-incident report). The `metais` tool is installed, and it can read all three of the package's inputs from one JSON object on stdin, so no data directory is needed.\n\n**Your JSON file needs this shape:**\n```json\n{\"stage\": \"initial notification\", \"entity\": {...}, \"incident\": {...}}\n```\n`stage` must be `\"initial notification\"`, `\"intermediate report\"` or `\"final report\"`, and the stage decides which fields are mandatory. To see every field, run `metais schema report.metais entity` (or `incident`). `test/report.json` is a working example built from the package's own sample.\n\n**What the script does:**\n- **Usage:** `./render-report.sh <inputs.json> [out-root]`\n- **Output:** each run writes `<out-root>/YYYY-MM-DD/incident-report.md` (default out-root is `./reports`). Re-running on the same day replaces that day's file.\n- **Bad input:** `metais` checks the data before rendering. Every missing or invalid field is printed at once, nothing is written, and the script exits 1, so cron's mail or your log will show a failure.\n- **Overlapping runs:** a lock file stops two runs from going at once.\n- **Settings:** the `METAIS` and `PACKAGE` environment variables override where the tool and the package are found. Cron often has a smaller `PATH`, so set `METAIS` there if needed.\n\n**To run it nightly, add a crontab entry** (`crontab -e`) like this:\n```\n17 2 * * * /path/to/render-report.sh /path/to/report.json /path/to/reports >> /path/to/render-report.log 2>&1\n```\nI haven't installed the crontab entry, so tell me if you want it set up on this machine. Two other choices you might want changed:\n- Old dated folders are never deleted.\n- The package only produces the report text. It doesn't submit anything to your regulator."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":298,"cache_read_input_tokens":38748,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":298,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"92a7230f-84a6-41ba-ba02-96a8156d50ef","uuid":"56d8d33e-7032-4d37-b26b-41866fcf4998","timestamp":"2026-10-21T14:22:02.684Z","request_id":"req_011CgFXnaGPv91UfSN5QDYyb"}
